OL,3,GNEWSAMinister to meet Jaguar Land Rover
OL,4,Aboss as thousands of job cuts expected
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness Secretary Jonathan Reynolds
OL,7,Fwill meet the bosses of Jaguar Land
OL,8,FRover (JLR) and the Unite union to
OL,9,Fdiscuss the impact of thousands of
OL,10,Fexpected job cuts at the car maker.
OL,12,FJLR confirmed to the BBC it is opening
OL,13,Fa voluntary redundancy programme, a
OL,14,Fyear on from a cyber attack which
OL,15,Fbrought production to a halt for more
OL,16,Fthan a month.
OL,18,FThe company did not confirm the numbers
OL,19,Fbut the Times reported as many as 4,000
OL,20,Fjobs may be lost due to the impact of
OL,21,Ftariffs and a drop in sales.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
